launch readiness, feature-set scope, customer-facing messaging, and market rollout plan for the v2 product release. PRODUCT_V2_DOC"},{"content":"Engineering document 2: Database migration guide. Run npm run db:migrate to apply the latest migrations to your PostgreSQL database."},{"content":"Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) augments LLM prompts with snippets retrieved from a vector store. Documents are chunked, embedded, and indexed; at query time a semantic search returns the most relevant chunks and the LLM grounds its answer in that retrieved context."}]}
